lapse  and his heart's doing good and Audia  doing good clients doing good goals  going forward to play Division one  football it doesn't matter where it  doesn't matter who I just know that I  want to get the team give it to you the  best of me  also want to start like a charity  foundation for pediatric cancer it's in  the works  he's in a good place you can see did he  don't know exactly where he's going but  he know he's going somewhere you know  and he feels that if he can overcome the  situation like this that he can overcome  anything  [Music]
 

